  m_text: 'GOOD ENDING



    The Tavern Lives On



    Thanks to your cooking,
    upgrades, and brave adventurers, the tavern has survived.

    The last dish
    has been served, the final quest is complete, and new stories will continue to
    begin at your door.



    You reached the good ending.

'
